-- MRT Jakarta weekday departure board, dayMask 4 (Mon-Fri).
--
-- Why this file exists: migration 0016 cleared MRT Jakarta's pre-day rows so a
-- day-aware sync could rewrite them, which is what happens locally. Production
-- never got that rewrite -- routes/sync.ts is deliberately unmounted there (see
-- the note in app.ts), so the DELETE landed and nothing repopulated it, leaving
-- every MRT Jakarta station with no board at all.
--
-- Generated from the local D1 rows produced by operators/mrtj/sync.ts against
-- the live datum feed on 2026-09-06, so the ids, trip numbers and terminus
-- names match exactly what a real sync writes. Regenerate rather than hand-edit.
--
-- WEEKDAY ONLY. The weekend board (dayMask 3, 2616 rows, ids carrying the extra
-- `-WE-` segment) is NOT in this file, so Saturday and Sunday queries return an
-- empty board until it is seeded separately.
--
-- Scoped DELETE mirrors insertTimetable: it clears only dayMask 4, so a weekend
-- board seeded later is left standing.
DELETE FROM schedules WHERE stationId LIKE 'MRTJ-%' AND dayMask = 4;

